# Cursor AI Rules - ProCPX Procurement System

## Unit Test Coverage Guidelines
- 90% Unit Test Code Coverage is strictly enforced per file across lines, statements, branches, and functions.
- Whenever making code changes, ALWAYS run:
  `npm run test:coverage`
- Do not skip any file. Every file in `src/` must maintain 90%+ coverage.
- Tests must use `--detectOpenHandles` to prevent unclosed resources.
- Global test timeout is configured at 30 seconds.
